  "id": "cultural-adaptability",
  "term": "cultural adaptability",
  "definition": "Cultural adaptability is a person’s ability to adjust to a new cultural environment. In this packet, it is described as socio-cultural adaptability, involving both cultural and psychological adjustment through learning how to function in the new setting and coping with the stress of change.",
